    'Plaid can create an Audit Copy token of an Asset Report and/or Income Report to share with participating Government Sponsored Entity (GSE). If you participate in the Day 1 Certainty™ program, Plaid can supply an Audit Copy token directly to Fannie Mae on your behalf. An Audit Copy token contains the same underlying data as the Asset Report and/or Income Report (result of /credit/payroll_income/get).\n\nUse the `/credit/audit_copy_token/create` endpoint to create an `audit_copy_token` and then pass that token to the GSE who needs access.',
